{"id": "idaho-1", "headline": "Caldwell Winter Wonderland opens, drawing Treasure Valley families", "source": "KIVI", "url": "https://www.kivitv.com/caldwell/winter-wonderland-returns-to-downtown-caldwell-drawing-families-from-across-the-treasure-valley", "published": "2026-11-21", "url_verified": true, "pages": ["Downtown Caldwell is lit up for the annual Winter Wonderland Festival, and families from across the Treasure Valley are filling the streets. The event follows months of preparation by local businesses getting ready for one of their busiest seasons and by a small crew that strings lights across downtown. Visitor Ralph Cloud, who has come since moving to the area in 2018, said the lights, crowds and friendly community make it a tradition for his family, and that he returns several times each season. The festival has grown into one of downtown Caldwell's largest yearly draws. More than 30,000 people have been known to visit during its three-day opening weekend.", "Why it matters: the event brings a major boost to downtown businesses at the start of the holiday shopping season. Source: KIVI."], "qr": {"n": 41, "rows": ["11111110101100101011110111001011001111111", "10000010010000001100110100001010101000001", "10111010100111100010100101110010101011101", "10111010111011100101001001110110001011101", "10111010100100011111011010110001001011101", "10000010010011101011100011100111001000001", "11111110101010101010101010101010101111111", "00000000000100101100001010010101000000000", "11110010100000111101010110100110110011101", "01000000011011000011111100001111101111011", "01001110010110101000010111000110111010110", "11110001101001111011000011000011101100011", "00011010011100010100000011111100010001101", "11001001110101111011000011011101001000111", "00010110001010101011010001100101111000111", "00000101100010111001011110011000001101010", "00000111101101111010111101000011000010010", "00111001011111010010111111010000100101000", "01001010000010010000011011010100101100010", "1